ent states:"},"435":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-31","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"},"436":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-32","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"},"437":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-33","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#component-customization","content":"Pass `className` or `style` to customize a checkbox field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive checkbox state:"},"438":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-34","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state","content":"The `isIndeterminate` prop displays a minus icon to represent a partial selection state. This is useful for \"select all\" checkboxes when only some items in a collection are selected."},"439":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-35","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"CheckboxGroup supports validation states and error messages:"},"440":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-36","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"},"441":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-37","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"},"442":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-38","page_id":"/docs/