,"1716":117,"1717":1659,"1718":1184,"1719":1331,"1720":1701,"1721":1620,"1722":1601,"1723":838,"1724":1169,"1725":804,"1726":678,"1727":447,"1728":1206,"1729":502,"1730":559,"1731":1403,"1732":1621,"1733":1626,"1734":1624,"1735":295,"1736":253,"1737":852,"1738":638,"1739":1013,"1740":1022,"1741":210,"1742":329,"1743":325,"1744":1602,"1745":1194,"1746":1625,"1747":716,"1748":568,"1749":712,"1750":1113,"1751":562,"1752":1289,"1753":1344,"1754":880,"1755":1494,"1756":879,"1757":881,"1758":567,"1759":1290,"1760":396,"1761":1345,"1762":397,"1763":1495,"1764":399},"orderedDocs":[[662,"**`<Text slot=\"label\">`** — any `Text` child with `slot=\"label\"` has its `id` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."],[663,"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."],[1458,"**`ButtonGroup`** - a cluster of related actions (a wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`). Overlay parents like `Modal` adopt it with end alignment and padding."],[1455,"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."],[1460,"**`CornerActions`** - an always-visible structural row for actions placed at a surface corner."],[442,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1457,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1459,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1456,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[765,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[764,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[772,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[773,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[771,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1637,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1210,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[753,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[221,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[757,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[323,"**Adjustable gap**: `cellPadding` sets the gap between cells in px"],[1463,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1601,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1635,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1243,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1365,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[1016,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[1015,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1244,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[236,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[750,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[804,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[232,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[231,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[755,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[234,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1715,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[392,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[828,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[270,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[265,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[267,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[266,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[826,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[269,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[436,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[435,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[812,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[320,"**Closed cells**: Set `value: null` to render a dashed-border empty rectangle for unavailable slots"],[752,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1600,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[1387,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1074,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1389,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[983,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[823,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[981,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1078,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1391,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1603,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1636,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1602,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[919,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[219,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[329,"**Custom tooltips**: Replace the built-in tooltip with any React node via `renderTooltip`, for example a period-over-period comparison; it is wrapped in the shared chart tooltip container"],[218,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[274,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[811,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[216,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[319,"**Discrete color buckets**: Define threshold ranges with explicit colors — no continuous gradient"],[813,"**DOM Output:**"],[758,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1631,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[829,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[817,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[325,"**Fills its container**: Give the chart (or its parent) a height and the rows stretch to fill it, up to `maxCellHeight`; a smaller height makes it scroll"],[802,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[338,"**Fixed height** (the `height` prop, or a parent with a height): `height` is the total, including the axis and legend."],[751,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1394,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[805,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[233,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[245,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[248,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[237,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[321,"**Hover cross-highlight**: Hovering or focusing a cell bolds the matching row and column axis labels"],[918,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[909,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[780,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[820,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[217,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[441,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[440,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[322,"**Keyboard accessible**: Focusing a cell shows its tooltip, the same as hovering"],[240,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[982,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1714,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[273,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[816,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[235,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[833,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[239,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1604,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[827,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1209,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[749,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[814,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[831,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[824,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1240,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1239,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[984,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1395,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[938,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[815,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[810,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[215,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[246,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1716,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[220,"**RTL support**: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences _(in development)_"],[328,"**RTL support**: Right-to-left layout with the row labels on the right (`AxisRight`)"],[244,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[241,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1362,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1363,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1454,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[446,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[275,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[213,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1390,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[980,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[324,"**Sized from its rows**: Without a `height`, the chart is as tall as its rows (`minCellHeight`, default 40px, plus the `cellPadding` gap), so it needs no sized container"],[1606,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[1076,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1393,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1245,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[445,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[1014,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1366,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[809,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[819,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1462,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[1075,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[249,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[327,"**Sticky axes**: Row and column labels remain visible while scrolling a large grid"],[238,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[759,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[803,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[444,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1242,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1364,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1634,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1632,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1633,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1211,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1692,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1691,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[253,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[242,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[326,"**Touch-friendly**: A cell is never smaller than 40px wide or tall, the minimum tap target. `minCellSize` (default 44, the cell plus its `cellPadding` gap) and `minCellHeight` (default 40) are raised to that floor if set lower; the SVG expands and the container scrolls"],[818,"**Trade-offs:**"],[760,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[1388,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[1017,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[920,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[222,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[754,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[330,"**TypeScript**: Generic `HeatmapChart<T>` — bring your own data shape with typed accessors"],[960,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[821,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[822,"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[832,"